# The production score file and its VERSION are live firm recommendations. They are distributed
# privately, as a pair, and they do not belong in any repository -- this one included. Named
# explicitly rather than relying on a blanket rule, so that adding a *.csv rule later cannot
# silently be the only thing standing between them and a commit.
ionic_scores_*.csv
!ionic_scores_*_DEMO.csv
VERSION.json
ionic-deck-automation/scores/
ionic-deck-automation/out/
ionic-deck-automation/statements/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
